#!/usr/bin/dyalogscript
⍝ Stemming benchmark: current per-word .NET calls vs batch wrapper formats.
⍝
⍝ Usage: Admin/BENCH/stem.apls [sizes] [min_ms]
⍝   sizes   comma-separated word counts (default 1,2,5,10,25,50,100,250,500,1000,2500,5000)
⍝   min_ms  timed budget per trial, repetitions adapt to reach it (default 100).
⍝           Each measurement runs 3 trials and reports the fastest.
⍝
⍝ Emits CSV to stdout: size,variant,thread,ms_per_call,words_per_ms

⎕IO←⎕ML←1
⎕PW←32767

∇ ms←(f Bench)data;t0;n;el;i;trial;runs
⍝ Mean over an adaptive batch, repeated TRIALS times, reporting the fastest. Noise only
⍝ ever adds time, so the minimum estimates the true cost; a mean drifts several-fold
⍝ when the dev stack and MariaDB compete for the same cores.
  runs←⍬
  :For trial :In ⍳TRIALS
      n←1
      :Repeat
          t0←⎕AI[3]
          :For i :In ⍳n ⋄ {}f data ⋄ :EndFor
          el←⎕AI[3]-t0
          :If ((el≥min_ms)∧n≥3)∨n≥1e6 ⋄ :Leave ⋄ :EndIf   ⍝ never report a single rep
          n×←2⌈⌈min_ms÷1⌈el
      :EndRepeat
      runs,←el÷n
  :EndFor
  ms←⌊/runs
∇

∇ r←LoadNuGet dir;f
⍝ ⎕FX each function; these are function source files, so ⎕FIX'file://' will not do.
  'NuGet'#.⎕NS''
  :For f :In (⊃⎕NINFO⍠1⊢dir,'/APLSource/NuGet/*.aplf')
      {}#.NuGet.⎕FX⊃⎕NGET f 1
  :EndFor
  r←≢#.NuGet.⎕NL ¯3
∇

∇ v←Vocabulary root;srcs;text;w
⍝ Real English from the repo's own prose — stemmer cost varies with suffix structure.
  srcs←(⊃⎕NINFO⍠1⊢root,'docs/*.md'),(⊂root,'CONTRIBUTING.md'),(⊂root,'README.md')
  srcs←(⎕NEXISTS¨srcs)/srcs
  text←∊{⊃⎕NGET ⍵}¨srcs
  w←∪(⎕C ⎕A)∘(∊⍨⊆⊢)⎕C text
  v←(2≤≢¨w)/w
  :If 100>≢v
      v←'running' 'packages' 'dyalog' 'arrays' 'conferences' 'programming' 'happily'
      v,←'nationalisation' 'the' 'quick' 'ingenuity' 'amicable' 'words' 'fugiativity'
  :EndIf
∇

⍝ ─── setup ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
argv←2 ⎕NQ # 'GetCommandLineArgs'
args←1↓argv
root←⊃⎕NPARTS ¯1↓⊃⎕NPARTS ¯1↓⊃⎕NPARTS⊃argv   ⍝ <root>/Admin/BENCH/stem.apls → <root>/

sizes←1 2 5 10 25 50 100 250 500 1000 2500 5000
:If 0<≢args ⋄ sizes←2⊃⎕VFI' '@(','∘=)⊃args ⋄ :EndIf
TRIALS←3
min_ms←100
:If 1<≢args ⋄ min_ms←⊃2⊃⎕VFI 2⊃args ⋄ :EndIf

{}LoadNuGet root,'packages/dyalog-NuGet-0.2.6'
⎕USING←(#.NuGet.Using root,'nuget-packages'),⊂'System'   ⍝ System for the marshalling controls

vocab←Vocabulary root
⎕RL←42
Sample←{vocab[?⍵⍴≢vocab]}

stemmer←⎕NEW Porter2Stemmer.EnglishPorter2Stemmer

⍝ ─── variants ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
⍝ All take and return a nested vector of char vectors, so timings include whatever
⍝ APL-side reshaping each format demands.
PerWord←{{(stemmer.Stem⊂⍵).Value}¨⍵}                        ⍝ current code
Nested←{Stemming.Batch.StemAll⊂⍵}                           ⍝ string[] <-> string[]
Delimited←{' '(≠⊆⊢)Stemming.Batch.StemLine⊂1↓∊' ',¨⍵}       ⍝ one string, both ways
⍝ Controls: same data across the boundary, no stemming. Bounds transport vs work.
MarshalNested←{String.Join ' '⍵}                            ⍝ string[] in
MarshalDelim←{String.Concat(⊂1↓∊' ',¨⍵)(⊂'')}               ⍝ one string in

⍝ ─── correctness gate ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ref←PerWord vocab
bad←''
:If ref≢Nested vocab ⋄ bad,←⊂'StemAll disagrees with per-word stemming' ⋄ :EndIf
:If ref≢Delimited vocab ⋄ bad,←⊂'StemLine disagrees with per-word stemming' ⋄ :EndIf
:If 0<≢bad
    ⎕←∊{⍵,⎕UCS 10}¨(⊂'CORRECTNESS FAILURE — not timing a wrong answer:'),bad
    ⎕OFF 1
:EndIf

⍝ ─── warm up ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
⍝ JIT and first-call assembly load are worth several ms; without this the first row
⍝ of the sweep reads roughly double.
{}PerWord 50↑vocab ⋄ {}Nested 50↑vocab ⋄ {}Delimited 50↑vocab
{}MarshalNested 50↑vocab ⋄ {}MarshalDelim 50↑vocab

⍝ ─── sweep ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
⍝ DCMS serves requests off thread 0, where APL→.NET calls cost ~7-10x more, so the
⍝ spawned column is the one that matters.
out←⊂'size,variant,thread,ms_per_call,words_per_ms'
Row←{(s v th ms)←⍵ ⋄ (⍕s),',',v,',',th,',',(⍕ms),',',{0=⍵:'' ⋄ ⍕⌊0.5+s÷⍵}ms}

fns←'PerWord' 'Nested' 'Delimited' 'MarshalNested' 'MarshalDelim'
labels←'per-word' 'nested' 'delimited' 'marshal-nested' 'marshal-delim'

:For n :In sizes
    data←Sample n
    :For i :In ⍳≢fns
        f←i⊃fns
        out,←⊂Row n(i⊃labels)'main'(⍎f,' Bench data')
        out,←⊂Row n(i⊃labels)'spawned'(⍎'⎕TSYNC(',f,' Bench)&data')
    :EndFor
:EndFor

⍝ Object construction, size-independent. Query.aplf currently pays this per request.
new←{t←⎕AI[3] ⋄ z←{⎕NEW Porter2Stemmer.EnglishPorter2Stemmer}¨⍳⍵ ⋄ (⎕AI[3]-t)÷⍵}
out,←⊂'0,new-stemmer,main,',(⍕new 2000),',0'

⎕←∊{⍵,⎕UCS 10}¨out
⎕OFF 0
